    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464500/extras/619b28c794d9d0f6759bf91fc88d6fd7.poster.avif?t=1709978595\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464500/extras/619b28c794d9d0f6759bf91fc88d6fd7.webm?t=1709978595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464500/extras/619b28c794d9d0f6759bf91fc88d6fd7.mp4?t=1709978595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Ruvato: Original Complex is a fast-paced hack and slash game.<br>Ria, the protagonist of this game, gains attack power and becomes stronger each time she defeats her enemy.<br>Play, get skilled, and chain-kill multiple enemies with ease using Ria\u2019s unique ability.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464500/extras/ec88bda45432132cf654b57f05112078.poster.avif?t=1709978595\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464500/extras/ec88bda45432132cf654b57f05112078.webm?t=1709978595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464500/extras/ec88bda45432132cf654b57f05112078.mp4?t=1709978595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br>* Unique system: Defeat an enemy or parry their attacks to become stronger.<br>* Easy to learn, hard to master.<br>* Over 100 action-packed levels with added platforming.<br>* Various achievements.<br>* Steam Cloud support.<br>* Optimized for gamepad.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464500/extras/619b28c794d9d0f6759bf91fc88d6fd7.poster.avif?t=1709978595\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464500/extras/619b28c794d9d0f6759bf91fc88d6fd7.webm?t=1709978595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464500/extras/619b28c794d9d0f6759bf91fc88d6fd7.mp4?t=1709978595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Ruvato: Original Complex is a fast-paced hack and slash game.<br>Ria, the protagonist of this game, gains attack power and becomes stronger each time she defeats her enemy.<br>Play, get skilled, and chain-kill multiple enemies with ease using Ria\u2019s unique ability.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464500/extras/ec88bda45432132cf654b57f05112078.poster.avif?t=1709978595\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464500/extras/ec88bda45432132cf654b57f05112078.webm?t=1709978595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464500/extras/ec88bda45432132cf654b57f05112078.mp4?t=1709978595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br>* Unique system: Defeat an enemy or parry their attacks to become stronger.<br>* Easy to learn, hard to master.<br>* Over 100 action-packed levels with added platforming.<br>* Various achievements.<br>* Steam Cloud support.<br>* Optimized for gamepad.",
